Note on game content

This license covers the source code and the tooling in this repository.

The `.pak` archives distributed here contain modifications of asset data from
The Crust, which is developed and owned by VEOM Studio. No original game content
is redistributed: the archives only override a handful of gameplay assets and are
intended for use by owners of a legitimate copy of the game.
